<%- include('partials/assessment-head',{title:config.title}) %><section class="info-hero-card"><p class="result-label">60-item guided reflection</p><h1><%= config.title %></h1><p>Think about <strong>your current daily experience</strong>. Choose the frequency that best describes your current experience for each statement or situation. There are no right or wrong answers.</p><p>This original questionnaire is not clinically validated and cannot diagnose a condition. You may stop or seek support at any point.</p><a href="#support-before">Need support now?</a></section><div id="support-before"><%- include('partials/support') %></div><% if(error){ %><p class="message" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><form action="/assessments/<%= config.id %>" method="POST" id="assessmentForm"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><section class="card"><label class="checkline"><input type="checkbox" name="adult" value="yes" <%= answers.adult==='yes'?'checked':'' %> required> I am 18 or older.</label><label class="checkline"><input type="checkbox" name="understand" value="yes" <%= answers.understand==='yes'?'checked':'' %> required> I understand this is a voluntary self-reflection exercise, not a clinical assessment.</label><p>Under 18? Seek an age-appropriate assessment with a qualified professional and a trusted adult where safe.</p><p>Answers stay on this page until submitted. They are not saved as a draft; refreshing or leaving may clear them.</p></section><div class="assessment-progress"><label for="assessmentProgress">Items completed</label><progress id="assessmentProgress" value="0" max="60"></progress><span id="progressText" aria-live="polite">0 of 60</span></div>
<% config.sections.forEach((section,index)=>{ %><section class="assessment-section test-section" data-section="<%= index %>"><h2 tabindex="-1">Section <%= index+1 %> of 6: <%= section.title %></h2><% section.questions.forEach((q,j)=>{ %><%- include('partials/test-question', {q,number:index*10+j+1,total:60,choices:options,answers}) %><% }) %></section><% }) %>
<div class="section-nav" hidden><button type="button" id="previousSection">Previous section</button><span id="sectionText"></span><button type="button" id="nextSection">Next section</button></div><section class="card" id="assessmentSubmit"><h2>View your response summary</h2><p>Your completed report is automatically saved to your account and shown on your dashboard. You can delete it from its result page. The report includes response counts and items marked Often or Almost always. This local prototype stores saved data in server-side JSON accessible to server administrators.</p><button type="submit">View my results</button><p><a href="/assessments">Exit assessment</a> (unsaved answers will be lost)</p></section></form></main></div></body></html>